## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: MedalUI
## Notes: The console (player, target, party, XP, minimap), an optional action bar on it, the corner strips (micro menu, bags, stats), and over them the chat and a side panel of loot, a meter, your auras and the zone (the minimap and its quests); and a bags window.
## Author: ahrymx
## Version: 0.77.0
## Category: MedalUI
## Category-enUS: MedalUI
## Group: MedalUI
